Upstream v0.40.0 now documents that a Live creation command ends its pane, so the older correction is redundant.
Keep only this build's differences: creation and attachment are one request (ngterm_term::session_io), so a short
command keeps its output instead of hitting upstream's ensure/attach race; a captured command's replay after a
clean quit and `session restart --command` still return to the persistent shell (ngterm_core::live::support).
The real-pane short and past-one-screen wait regressions in crates/ngterm-term/tests/live.rs cover retained output.
Applied after 0009-other-platforms.patch.

